{"seq":37,"slug":"startup-growth-metrics","title":"创业增长指标","stage":"DONE","category":"management","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/startup-growth-metrics","rating":{"composite":4.02,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"创业增长指标\">创业增长指标</h1><p>当一个创业团队坐在投资人面前被问到&quot;你的单位经济模型健康吗&quot;时，能否用三个数字讲清楚自己的增长逻辑，决定了对话能否进入下一轮。增长指标不是仪表盘上的装饰品，而是创业者用来诊断产品健康度、分配有限资源、向市场证明价值的核心工具。</p>\n<p>本 hub 系统性地拆解创业公司从 0 到 1 阶段最关键的增长指标体系。与兄弟 hub「技术创业」侧重创业流程（验证想法→MVP→PMF→融资→团队）不同，本 hub 聚焦于<strong>量化度量本身</strong>——每个指标的定义、计算、基准线、诊断逻辑和改进杠杆。与「财务独立与生活设计」关注个人财务模型也有本质区别：这里的视角是企业级增长引擎而非个人资产配置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p><strong>路径一：从零建立指标体系（推荐初次创业者）</strong></p>\n<p>按章节顺序阅读：先掌握基础框架（AARRR、North Star Metric、PMF 量化），再深入获客（CAC、激活、裂变）、变现（LTV、MRR/ARR、定价）、运营（留存、群组分析、增长实验）四大模块。</p>\n<p><strong>路径二：诊断特定问题（推荐有产品已上线的团队）</strong></p>\n<p>根据当前痛点直接跳到对应章节：留存曲线下滑→运营篇；CAC 持续上升→获客篇；无法向投资人讲清单位经济→变现篇。</p>\n<p><strong>路径三：融资准备（推荐即将融资的创始人）</strong></p>\n<p>重点阅读 MRR/ARR 收入指标、LTV 与单位经济、群组分析三篇，这是投资人尽调时必看的数据维度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>基本的产品开发流程认知（MVP 是什么、用户反馈循环）</li>\n<li>初步的统计概念（比率、百分比、趋势）</li>\n<li>了解 SaaS/互联网产品的基本商业模式有助于深入理解，但非必需</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"指标基础与框架","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/startup-growth-metrics/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"metrics-framework-overview","title":"增长指标框架总览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/startup-growth-metrics/foundations/metrics-framework-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pmf-measurement","title":"PMF 量化验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/startup-growth-metrics/foundations/pmf-measurement"},{"seq":3,"slug":"vanity-vs-actionable-metrics","title":"虚荣指标与可行动指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/startup-growth-metrics/foundations/vanity-vs-actionable-metrics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"acquisition","title":"获客与激活指标","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/startup-growth-metrics/acquisition","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"customer-acquisition-cost","title":"客户获取成本（CAC）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/startup-growth-metrics/acquisition/customer-acquisition-cost"},{"seq":2,"slug":"activation-and-onboarding","title":"激活与首次体验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/startup-growth-metrics/acquisition/activation-and-onboarding"},{"seq":3,"slug":"viral-coefficient-referral","title":"病毒系数与裂变增长","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/startup-growth-metrics/acquisition/viral-coefficient-referral"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"monetization","title":"变现与收入指标","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/startup-growth-metrics/monetization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ltv-and-unit-economics","title":"LTV 与单位经济模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/startup-growth-metrics/monetization/ltv-and-unit-economics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mrr-arr-revenue-metrics","title":"MRR 与 ARR 收入指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/startup-growth-metrics/monetization/mrr-arr-revenue-metrics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pricing-monetization-models","title":"定价与变现模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/startup-growth-metrics/monetization/pricing-monetization-models"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"运营与增长实验","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/startup-growth-metrics/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"retention-and-churn","title":"留存与流失分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/startup-growth-metrics/operations/retention-and-churn"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cohort-analysis","title":"群组分析（Cohort Analysis）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/startup-growth-metrics/operations/cohort-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"growth-experimentation","title":"增长实验与数据驱动决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/startup-growth-metrics/operations/growth-experimentation"}]}]}